    {
      "id": 256920,
      "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
      "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-02-20T12:35:16.651Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I mean, if we’re going to be exacting about it, the length of a single solar revolution varies from “year” to “year” anyway (we lose about .0055 seconds each time IIRC) and a “day” is a pretty arbitrary unit of measurement - and that’s not even considering the whole “leap year” kludge we’ve got going on.</p>\n<p>I’m sure Tachyon notices this stuff, a fraction of a second is a usable period of time for her.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Alternately, the cake has nothing to do with the passage of time, and GLaDOS is trying to recruit you for a study.  Might want to be wary of portals for a while.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-02-20T12:38:19.460Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 4,
